      "grouping_at_time": "Equipment",
      "title_at_revision": "Fire protection for oxygen equipment.",
      "text": "(a) Oxygen equipment and lines may not be in any designated fire zone.\n(b) Oxygen equipment and lines must be protected from heat that may be generated in, or escape from, any designated fire zone.\n(c) Oxygen equipment and lines must be installed so that escaping oxygen cannot cause ignition of grease, fluid, or vapor accumulations that are present in normal operation or as a result of failure or malfunction of any system.",
